# Lists by mouse: a click selects a row, the second press of a double
# click on the row just clicked opens it, a second press elsewhere does
# nothing, and a click on the header or on a blank row selects nothing.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
S LIST
C 4 20
S ROW2
C 3 5
S ROW1
C 2 20
S HEADER
C 12 20
S BLANK
C 4 30
D 3 30
S DOTHER
D 4 30
S DNOCLICK
C 4 30
D 4 30
S ITEM
K ESC
S BACK
C 3 1
S COL1
C 5 78
D 5 78
S EDGE
K ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
